<title>USA: Ergo Science Corp stake lifted by group.</title>
<headline>Ergo Science Corp stake lifted by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Gary Tanaka said Friday it raised its stake in Ergo Science Corp to 1,539,000 common shares or 11.82 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 200,000 common shares between December 20, 1996 and January 17, 1997 at prices ranging from $13.05 to $14.625 per share.</p>
</text>
